<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Tony made a triangle from his thumbs and index fingers, and adjusted it. \'91Eighteen percent is about this much of the pie?\'92 he asked, holding his hands out.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91A little less,\'92 Fisher said.\
