<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Of course, sir. But perhaps you would prefer a shower and some clean clothes? Unless you would prefer to honour your friend by wearing his blood and \'85 other organic materials around with you.\'92\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable> Tony followed Fisher\'92s gaze to his own feet, and saw the drying red-brown stains on his trainers and jeans below the knees. He nodded solemnly.\
